  "content": {
    "id": "p45-q8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Consider the expansion:\n$$(1+x)^{2n}={}^{2n}C_0+{}^{2n}C_1x+\\cdots+{}^{2n}C_{2n}x^{2n}.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p45-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "By differentiating both sides of the identity, show that:\n$$1\\times{}^{2n}C_1+2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}=n2^{2n}.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Differentiate, then substitute $x=1$:\n$$1\\times{}^{2n}C_1+2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}=2n2^{2n-1}=n2^{2n}.$$",
          "worked": "Differentiating both sides gives\n$$\\begin{align*}2n(1+x)^{2n-1}&={}^{2n}C_1+2\\,{}^{2n}C_2x+3\\,{}^{2n}C_3x^2+\\cdots+2n\\,{}^{2n}C_{2n}x^{2n-1}.\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute $x=1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2n(2)^{2n-1}&={}^{2n}C_1+2\\,{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+2n\\,{}^{2n}C_{2n}\\\\n2^{2n}&=1\\times{}^{2n}C_1+2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p45-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "And show that\n$$1\\times{}^{2n}C_1-2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+(-1)^{2n-1}2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}=0.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Substitute $x=-1$ into the differentiated identity:\n$$1\\times{}^{2n}C_1-2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+(-1)^{2n-1}2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}=2n(0)^{2n-1}=0.$$",
          "worked": "Substitute $x=-1$ into the differentiated identity from part a:\n$$\\begin{align*}2n(0)^{2n-1}&={}^{2n}C_1-2\\,{}^{2n}C_2+3\\,{}^{2n}C_3-\\cdots+(-1)^{2n-1}2n\\,{}^{2n}C_{2n}\\\\0&=1\\times{}^{2n}C_1-2\\times{}^{2n}C_2+\\cdots+(-1)^{2n-1}2n\\times{}^{2n}C_{2n}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 43
      }
    ]
  },
